        "heading": "Go beyond surface-level skincare",
        "wistia_url": "33syv1nzsz",
        "wistia_url_mobile": "1ovt3rrmz3",
        "text": "<p>Traditional creams are applied to the skin’s surface, where the skin barrier can limit how effectively active ingredients are absorbed.</p><p>Qure uses ultra-fine, <em>24K gold-plated 0.5 mm microneedles</em> to create tiny microchannels on the skin’s surface. As you stamp, concentrated serums are applied with precision, helping active ingredients absorb more effectively where they’re needed.</p>",
